flowchart TD
    Start([Start: LoadStudentDashboard]) --> Input[/Input: student_id/]
    Input --> CheckEmpty{student_id empty?}
    
    CheckEmpty -- Yes --> Err1[/Return Error: Invalid identity/]
    
    CheckEmpty -- No --> QQueries[(Query D3: QUERIES)]
    QQueries --> Sort[Sort by updated_at descending]
    Sort --> LoopStart{More queries to process?}
    
    LoopStart -- Yes --> QDocs[(Query D4: DOCUMENTS)]
    QDocs --> QMeetings[(Query D5: MEETINGS)]
    QMeetings --> Combine[Combine into compiled_record]
    Combine --> InsertList[Insert into dashboard_view]
    InsertList --> LoopStart
    
    LoopStart -- No --> Output[/Return Success: dashboard_view/]
    Output --> End([End])
    
    Err1 --> End